 ## Project Context
 
-- Follow [StarterApp architecture](../../../docs/architecture.md) for the installed APIs and directory conventions. Keep operations in the model namespace; do not introduce a generic `app/services` tree just to match an example.
-- Use Action Policy (`authorize!`), Active Delivery (`delivers` and `PasswordsDelivery.reset(user).deliver_later`), Anyway Config, and ViewComponent already present in the project. Keep jobs inheriting from `ApplicationJob`; check `Gemfile.lock` before applying an `active_job-performs` example.
-- Use `ApplicationAgent` / `Llm.build_chat` and [the agent contract](../../../docs/agents.md) for AI work. Retain after-commit delivery, Isolator, explicit inputs, and private Turbo Streams for web and Android.
-- Check `Gemfile.lock` and the relevant implementation before using a gem-specific example; validate with the Minitest/Cuprite workflow in [testing](../../../docs/testing.md).
